{"id":"vod_sn_36520","vodId":"36520","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"亡念的扎姆德","name_cn":"亡念的扎姆德","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a5aa45b9265316cd23ef763fcad3d425.jpg"},"summary":"“即使如此人们还是不得不扪心自问、仔细斟酌……”　　尖端岛是一个被油泥海包围着的小岛。　　小岛因70年前发生的战争而被“南大陆自由圈”接管，アキユキ（男）与母亲一起在小岛上生活。　　父亲经营着一间小诊所，过着与母子两人的分居生活。　　某日，アキユキ与好友ハル以及フルイチ在上学的途中被卷入了一起爆炸事件。　　爆炸中，アキユキ的手臂遭到了爆炸物射出的神秘光线的照射，变身成了名为“ザムド（Xam'd）”的怪物。　　就在此时，名为ナキアミ的红发异国少女出现在因丧失自我而四处暴走中的Xam'd面前……　　阻止Xam'd的暴走后，ナキアミ将アキユキ带上了国际邮船ザンバニ号。　　アキユキ为了今后能够控制Xam'd的力量并回到尖端岛，与ザンバニ号上结识的伙伴们一起开始了环游世界的旅行。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VqeVQLaMY11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fwd1iQYFPM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mw6fyzuSWA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5VLwhVG3bv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9gRET6GpRB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HCxNYZHzkU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/28gDSUqEBP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VxNdTiQYWF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m4deHVvwzE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/97Kfw2J8pP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UZiLvT8gZj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mVTnRcsT4N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/attZFRVHcs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/